<title>USA: Pepsi-Cola Puerto Rico named in class action.</title>
<headline>Pepsi-Cola Puerto Rico named in class action.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-10-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Pepsi-Cola Puerto Rico Bottling Co said Wednesday that it has been named a defender in several class action shareholder lawsuits relating to disclosures in financial statements for the first and second quarters of fiscal 1996 and in other documents.</p>
<p>The company said it intends to defend against the suits vigorously.</p>
</text>
